# WhipRadio secrets & local configuration.
#
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in real values. ".env" is gitignored —
# never commit real secrets.
#
# On every platform (Windows / Linux / macOS / WSL) the Aspire AppHost loads
# this file at startup and seeds the process environment for itself, the
# Orchestrator, the Web app, and the Icecast container. Real environment
# variables always take precedence over values here, so CI/production can
# inject secrets without a file.

# --- Icecast passwords (REQUIRED) ------------------------------------------
# Source password: used by ffmpeg to push the stream to the mount.
# Admin password: protects the Icecast admin UI.
# Use strong values for anything beyond an isolated local machine.
ICECAST_SOURCE_PASSWORD=change-me-source
ICECAST_ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-admin

# Relay password (Icecast internal relay auth). Falls back to the source
# password if left blank.
ICECAST_RELAY_PASSWORD=change-me-relay

# --- Optional overrides ----------------------------------------------------
# Writer Room (Ollama) endpoint. Default: http://localhost:8001
# (host port 8001 maps to the container's native 11434, see start-studios.ps1)
# Llm__Endpoint=http://localhost:8001

# Public stream URL surfaced in the Web UI. Auto-derived from Icecast when blank.
# Stream__PublicUrl=http://localhost:8000/radio.mp3
